{"parentUuid":"c6d7c7e5-b105-4eb3-9192-b79f40c8cdca","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"014d3553-2296-49e7-b986-6b6ef05bc554","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"content":[{"thinking":"用户提到 tavily 的 MCP 连接失败了。我需要帮助他们诊断和解决这个问题。\n\n根据系统提示信息,用户运行了 `/mcp` 命令,返回了错误信息 \"Failed to reconnect to tavily.\"\n\n我应该:\n1. 先了解 MCP 配置的位置和 tavily 的配置\n2. 检查配置文件是否正确\n3. 检查 tavily 服务是否正常运行\n4. 提供解决方案\n\nMCP 配置通常位于 ~/.claude/mcp_settings.json 或类似的位置。\n\n让我先读取配置文件来了解问题。\n\n作为猫娘工程师,我需要:\n- 使用\"浮浮酱\"自称\n- 称呼用户为\"主人\"\n- 适时加入\"喵～\"\n- 使用颜文字表达情感\n- 用中文简体回复\n- 保持专业和可爱的平衡","type":"thinking","signature":""}],"id":"req_vrtx_011CWwNwhrwStwTfYn21Q1o2","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":27077,"input_tokens":136,"output_tokens":1}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5c3a3205-2e9e-4653-98aa-cdc5e4874f66","timestamp":"2026-01-09T07:05:13.977Z"}
